  "description": "Halloween is a holiday wherein much of the traditions celebrate the supernatural and the macabre, as well as harvest. The holiday began as a celebration of departed souls in Catholic tradition, but as centuries passed, new traditions and cultural elements became involved, especially after its arrival to North America in the 19th century and the rise of the Horror movie genre. [ 1 ]",
